        <!--
            SPIKE variant B - nine-slice via the COT IMAGESET (the vanilla way).
            Slices come from JM/COT/GUI/imagesets/cot_gui.imageset, which is
            hand-authored: .edds is a plain DDS (Pillow writes DXT5), and the
            {GUID} on the texture path is not authoritative - four vanilla
            imagesets, rover_imageset included, carry a GUID that disagrees with
            their own .meta and still resolve.
        -->
